{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/65f1b1ceacab6541dd9f28ab03f99c6e.poster.avif?t=1756384112\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/65f1b1ceacab6541dd9f28ab03f99c6e.webm?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/65f1b1ceacab6541dd9f28ab03f99c6e.mp4?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hell. Awakening in a familiar office, you will now engage in life-or-death games using dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/6d24f41d997765877f1673be1d65b910.poster.avif?t=1756384112\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/6d24f41d997765877f1673be1d65b910.webm?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/6d24f41d997765877f1673be1d65b910.mp4?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice combinations are straightforward. Recognize the hands and match the combinations. The swords, various items, and curses granted by your combinations will force strategic choices to harm your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/342c4f2ca8d064a999678dd2e3abaa33.poster.avif?t=1756384112\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/342c4f2ca8d064a999678dd2e3abaa33.webm?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/342c4f2ca8d064a999678dd2e3abaa33.mp4?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you win? Savor your triumph. The relics, dice, and pills granted after victory will aid you in navigating through this hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is that choice really better? Think carefully. You're not the only one receiving such rewards. Think deeper and make the best choice. Your previous rewards will become the foundation for your next ones. The more you think, the stronger you can become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, even then, We're not sure if you'll be able to overcome all those enemies who, like you, have climbed up by defeating others...</p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/5df03f53b096d614b8425cbf2b92dd50.poster.avif?t=1756384112\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/5df03f53b096d614b8425cbf2b92dd50.webm?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/5df03f53b096d614b8425cbf2b92dd50.mp4?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry. Death is not an escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to reach the end of this hell? Or will you simply remain in the abyss?</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964420?t=1756384112","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964420?t=1756384112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/417af6af660dbbcc31aa7ef73c4ebb0ab6d8b0e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756384112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/417af6af660dbbcc31aa7ef73c4ebb0ab6d8b0e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756384112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/65f1b1ceacab6541dd9f28ab03f99c6e.poster.avif?t=1756384112\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/65f1b1ceacab6541dd9f28ab03f99c6e.webm?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/65f1b1ceacab6541dd9f28ab03f99c6e.mp4?t=1756384112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hell. Awakening in a familiar office, you will now engage in life-or-death games using dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/6d24f41d997765877f1673be1d65b910.poster.avi